Description: A design-aware orchestration layer for classical and modern mixed-model
    analyses in agronomy and related experimental sciences. The package connects legacy
    split-plot error strata with linear and generalized linear mixed models, residual
    covariance structures, robust estimation, bootstrap inference, generalized additive
    models for location scale and shape, Bayesian multilevel models, nonlinear mixed
    models, spatial field-trial analysis, multi-environment trials, diagnostics,
    publication-ready figures and tables, and guided teaching workflows. Estimation is
    delegated to established R engines and the design, assumptions, inference and
    provenance are retained in auditable result objects.
